{"path":"memory/shared_ptr/~shared_ptr","title":"std::shared_ptr<T>::~shared_ptr","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::shared_ptr&lt;T&gt;::</span>~shared_ptr","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr/~shared_ptr","section":"memory","kind":"page","summary":"If *this owns an object and it is the last shared_ptr owning it, the object is destroyed through the owned deleter.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">~shared_ptr<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> owns an object and it is the last <code>shared_ptr</code> owning it, the object is destroyed through the owned deleter. \n</p><p>After the destruction, the smart pointers that shared ownership with <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>, if any, will report a <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr/use_count\">use_count()</a></span> that is one less than its previous value.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>Unlike <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/unique_ptr\">std::unique_ptr</a></span>, the deleter of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\">std::shared_ptr</a></span> is invoked even if the managed pointer is null.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;memory&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> S\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    S<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"S::S()<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    ~S<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"S::~S()<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> Deleter\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> operator<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>S<span class=\"sy2\">*</span> s<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"S::Deleter()<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            delete s<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> sp <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/shared_ptr\"><span class=\"kw738\">std::<span class=\"me2\">shared_ptr</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>S<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span>new S, S<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">Deleter</span><span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> use_count <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>sp<span class=\"br0\">]</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span> c<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> c <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\") use_count(): \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> sp.<span class=\"me1\">use_count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    use_count<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'A'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> sp2 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> sp<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        use_count<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'B'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> sp3 <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> sp<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            use_count<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'C'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n        use_count<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'D'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    use_count<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'E'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"co1\">//  sp.reset();</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//  use_count('F'); // would print \"F) use_count(): 0\"</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>S::S()\nA) use_count(): 1\nB) use_count(): 2\nC) use_count(): 3\nD) use_count(): 2\nE) use_count(): 1\nS::Deleter()\nS::~S()</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/memory/weak_ptr/~weak_ptr\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(destructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  destroys a <code>weak_ptr</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::weak_ptr&lt;T&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"memory","title":"Memory management library"},{"path":"memory/shared_ptr","title":"std::shared_ptr"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::shared_ptr<T>::~shared_ptr","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. If *this owns an object and it is the last shared_ptr owning it, the object is destroyed through the owned deleter."},{"label":"Notes","note":"Unlike std::unique_ptr, the deleter of std::shared_ptr is invoked even if the managed pointer is null."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(destructor)","note":"destroys a weak_ptr"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":184,"codeBlockCount":2}
